(2041, 182, 2, 'Which of the following is a better deal for a customer? <br>\r\nA. 10 successive discounts of 4%<br>\r\nB. 1 whole discount of 40%<br>\r\nC. 4 successive discounts of 10%	\r\n', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'Both A and B', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
