(2044, 182, 2, 'Motilal, a rice vendor, uses a faulty weighing stone of weight 480 grams instead of a half- kilogram stone. If he claims to be selling at the cost price, what is his profit percentage?', '4.16%', '4%', '5.6%', '6.5%', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1),
