(2046, 182, 3, 'Using the digits 1, 3, 5, 6 and 8, how many numbers can be formed such that the sum of the digits of each of the numbers is even, and no digit appears more than once?', '14', '30', '29', '118', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
