(2056, 184, 3, 'In a 5000 meters race, â€˜Mâ€™ beats â€˜Nâ€™ by 600 meters and in an 800 meters race, â€˜Nâ€™ beats â€˜Pâ€™ by 200 meteRs. By how many meters will â€˜Mâ€™ beat â€˜Pâ€™ in a 1500 meters race?', '510 meters	', '610 meters', '890 meters	', '990 meters', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1),
(2058, 184, 2, '<b>Directions for questions</b><br> \r\nRefer the following data to answer the questions given below.<br><br>\r\n\r\nEach item has a question followed by two statements A & B. <br>\r\nWhat is the ratio of Varunâ€™s new annual salary to his old annual salary?\r\n	A. His new salary is Rs. 25 more per month than his old salary.\r\n	B. His old salary is 20 percent less than his new salary.\r\n', 'if the question can be answered using statement A alone. ', 'if the question can be answered using statement B alone. ', 'if the question can be answered using both the statements, but not using either statement alone. ', 'if the question cannot be answered even after using both the statements.', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
