(2063, 184, 2, '<b>Directions for questions</b><br> \r\n: Refer the following data to answer the questions given below.<br><br>\r\n\r\n	Each item has a question followed by two statements A & B. <br>\r\nIf â€˜mâ€™ and â€˜nâ€™ are odd numbers, is   7/2+n/2+m/3  an integer?\r\n	A. â€˜nâ€™ is a multiple of 9.\r\n	B. 12 is a factor of m.\r\n', 'if the question can be answered using statement A alone. ', 'if the question can be answered using statement B alone.', 'if the question can be answered using both the statements, but not using either statement alone. ', 'if the question cannot be answered even after using both the statements.', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
