(2065, 184, 2, '<b>Directions for questions</b><br> \r\nRefer the following data to answer the questions given below.<br><br>\r\n\r\n	Each item has a question followed by two statements A & B. <br>\r\nWhat is the average of six numbers?\r\n	A. Average of five numbers is 6 more than the sixth number.\r\n	B. The six numbers are even consecutive integeRs. \r\n', 'if the question can be answered using statement A alone. ', 'if the question can be answered using statement B alone. ', 'if the question can be answered using both the statements, but not using either statement alone.', 'if the question cannot be answered even after using both the statements.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
