(2101, 188, 2, '<b>Directions for questions</b> \r\n: Refer the following data to answer the questions given below<br><br>\r\n\r\nRuns scored by Ashwin in a match are 10 more than the balls faced by Vijay. The number of balls faced by Ashwin is equal to the number of runs scored by Vijay. Together they have scored 80 runs and Ashwin has faced 10 balls less than Vijay. <br>\r\nWhat is the number of runs scored by Ashwin?\r\n', '30', '20', '40', '50', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
