(2110, 190, 2, 'A boy, with a given amount, can buy either 10 chocolates or 15 pencils or 2 game CDs. Find the maximum number of pencils that he can buy with six times the initial amount, such that he buys each of the 3 articles.', '75', '81', '60', 'Indeterminate ', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
