(2165, 194, 2, 'Manisha and Shikha start a business with Rs. 40000 each. At the end of 3 months Shikha withdraws Rs. 8000 from her investment. What percent (approximately) of the total profit would Shikha receive at the end of the year?', '33.33%', '45%	', '50%			', '46 %', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
