(2348, 216, 2, 'A petrol tank at a filling station has a capacity of 400 L. The attendant sells 40L of petrol from the tank to one customer and then replenishes it with kerosene oil. This process is repeated for six customers. What quantity of kerosene will seventh customer get when he purchases 40 L of petrol?', '19.5 L', '18.75 L	', '20 L	', '15.25 L   ', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
