(2359, 216, 2, 'A train covers a certain distance moving at the speed of 60 kmph. However if were to halt every hour for a fixed time period every hour, its average speed comes out to be 50 kmph. For how much time does train halt for every hour?  	', '6 minutes', '10 minutes	', '12 minutes		', '8 minutes', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
(2360, 216, 2, 'Atul and Bikram run with speeds of 30 m/s and 20 m/s around a circular track of 600 m in the same direction. They participate in a 3600 m race. What is distance covered by Atul when he passes Bikram for 2nd time?', '2200 m	', '2250 m', '2850 m		', '3600 m', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
(2361, 216, 1, 'A clock loses 2 minutes in an hour and another clock gains 2 minutes in every 2 hours. Both these clocks are set correctly at a certain time on Sunday and both the clocks stop simultaneously on the next day with the time shown being 8 am and 8:33 am. What is the correct time at which they stopped?', '8:24 am	', '8:44 pm', '8:46 am	', '8:22 am', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
(2362, 216, 2, 'Lal breaks pencil in such a way that the ratio of two broken parts is same as that of original length of pencil to one of larger part of pencil. The ratio of the other part to the original length of pencil is', '2	', '2:âˆš5', '2: (3 +âˆš5)	', 'Indeterminate', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1),
(2363, 218, 3, 'In a game of basket-ball each of the players numbered from 1 to 100, put as many baskets as the number of factors of their respective numbers, whatâ€™s the sum of top two numbers of baskets put?', '20', '21', '22', '23', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1),
