(2498, 233, 2, '<b>Directions for questions</b>: <br>Read the following data to answer the questions given below. <br>\r\n\r\nAlwin, Bhavya, Chinki, Dolly, Elsa, Fiza and Gowri are seven persons sitting in a row for a photo session. Chinki sits to the immediate left of Alwin and Fiza sits to the immediate right of Dolly. Bhavya has equal number of persons on either side of her in the row. Alwin sits to the immediate left of Bhavya and there are exactly three persons between Alwin and Gowri. <br>\r\nIf Dolly and Elsa exchange their places in the row, which of the following must be false? <br>\r\n', ' Elsa is to the right of Bhavya, as seen by the photographer. <br>', 'Bhavya is in the middle of the row. <br>', 'Dolly and Fiza sit together. <br>', 'Gowri is at one of the extreme ends.', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1),
(2499, 233, 2, '<b>Directions for questions</b>: <br>Read the data given below and answer the questions that follow. <br>\r\n\r\nNine patients Prithvi, Neel, Armaan, Rohan, Charlie, Virat, Ranveer, Gokul and Sohail are seated in a row. The seats are numbered from 1 to 9 from left to right as per the following restrictions. Armaan, Virat and Sohail sit together. Charlie is to the immediate right of Gokul. Neel sits in the fourth seat from the left end and Rohan sits in the third seat from the right end. Charlie is not between Neel and Rohan. <br>\r\n\r\nIf Ranveer sits to the immediate left of Rohan, then who will sit in the centre seat of the row?\r\n', 'Neel', 'Prithvi ', 'Rohan 		', 'Virat', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
