(2518, 233, 1, '<b>Directions for questions </b>: <br>Refer the following data to answer the questions below. <br>\r\n\r\nManoj, Naresh, Omar, Pankaj, Bala, Ram, Shyam, Tarun, Arun, Varun and Muthu, are eleven persons in a team. Bala is elected as their captain. Omar and Varun sit together and there are exactly four seats between the two pairs Pankaj & Ram and Varun & Muthu. Tarun and Arun sit together and Tarun is to the immediate right of Shyam, who is next to Bala.  No one sits to the left of Pankaj. <br>\r\n\r\nMuthu sits exactly at the fifth place, from right, to the right of\r\n', 'Ram', 'Manoj', 'Bala		', 'Pankaj', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1),
