(2521, 233, 1, 'If Pankaj and Ram exchange their seats with Varun and Muthu respectively, then which of the following conditions will be violated?', 'Manoj and Naresh sit together.	', 'There are no persons between Muthu and Ram.', 'Arun is at one of the extreme ends.', 'There are five persons between Pankaj and Muthu.', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
