(2594, 239, 2, '<b>Directions for questions: </b><br> Refer the following information to answer the question given below. <br>\r\n\r\nThe Khanna family is planning Poojaâ€™s wedding. Poojaâ€™s maternal grandma, Damini is the oldest living member of the family and while sending out invitations notices that all of her children, nieces, and nephews are still married to their original spouses. The spouses have never been previously married. <br>\r\n\r\nRahul is the eldest son of Damini and has one brother, Manish Khanna, and one sister, Preeti. Damini''s only sister, Vimala, has two children: son Ritesh Khanna, and daughter, Karishma. Mona is Karishma''s only daughter. <br>\r\nRahul''s wife is Pooja''s\r\n', 'Mother', 'Stepmother	', 'Sister', 'Aunt', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
