(2597, 239, 2, '<b>Directions for questions: </b><br> Refer the following information to answer the question given below. <br>\r\n\r\nThe Khanna family is planning Poojaâ€™s wedding. Poojaâ€™s maternal grandma, Damini is the oldest living member of the family and while sending out invitations notices that all of her children, nieces, and nephews are still married to their original spouses. The spouses have never been previously married. <br>\r\n\r\nRahul is the eldest son of Damini and has one brother, Manish Khanna, and one sister, Preeti. Damini''s only sister, Vimala, has two children: son Ritesh Khanna, and daughter, Karishma. Mona is Karishma''s only daughter. <br>\r\n\r\nRahulâ€™s wifeâ€™s sister, Rekhaâ€™s son is getting married to Pooja. How will Rahulâ€™s wife be related to Pooja now?\r\n', 'Mother-in-law', 'Aunt', 'Cousin		', 'Niece', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
(2598, 239, 2, '<b>Directions for questions: </b><br> Refer the following information to answer the question given below. <br>\r\n\r\nFour shirts are next to each other in a wardrobe in order from left to right. One of the shirts is red, one is black, one is purple, and one is orange. The red shirt is between the black and purple shirts. The purple shirt is between the orange and red shirts. The orange shirt is not fourth. <br>\r\nWhich of the following can be deduced from the given information? <br>\r\n	(i) The red shirt is not fourth. <br>\r\n	(ii) The purple shirt is not first. <br>\r\n	(iii) The black shirt is not second. <br>\r\n', 'i only	', 'ii only', 'i and ii only	', 'i, ii and iii', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
(2599, 239, 2, '<b>Directions for questions: </b><br> Refer the following information to answer the question given below. <br>\r\n\r\nFour shirts are next to each other in a wardrobe in order from left to right. One of the shirts is red, one is black, one is purple, and one is orange. The red shirt is between the black and purple shirts. The purple shirt is between the orange and red shirts. The orange shirt is not fourth. <br>\r\n\r\nIf a white shirt is added to shelf, then which of the following is a possible order of the shirts?\r\n', 'black, red, orange, purple, white	', 'white, black, purple, red, orange', 'black, red, purple, white, orange	', 'purple, red, black, orange, white', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1),
