(4559, 319, 2, 'The total of the list of balances in Valleyâ€™s payables ledger was $438,900 at 30 June 20X6. This balance did not agree with Valleyâ€™s payables ledger control account balance. The following errors were discovered:<br><br>\r\n\r\n(1)	A contra entry of $980 was recorded in the payables ledger control account, but not in the payables ledger.<br>\r\n\r\n(2)	The total of the purchase returns daybook was undercast by $1,000.<br>\r\n\r\n(3)	An invoice for $4,344 was posted to the supplierâ€™s account as $4,434.<br><br>\r\n\r\nWhat amount should Valley report in its statement of financial position for accounts payable at 30 June 20X6?</br>\r\n', '$436,830', '$438,010', '$439,790', '$437,830', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
