(4541, 317, 2, 'Typical specifications for design stipulates the gain margin and phase margin to be respectively', '< 1.7 and < 30Â°', '> 1.7 and > 30Â°', '> 1.7 and < 30Â°', '< 1.7 and > 30Â°', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
