(2653, 242, 2, '<b>Directions for Questions from</b>: In each of the following questions one word is different from the rest. Find out the word which does not belong to the group<br>\r\nA. Kiwi	B. Eagle		C. Emu		D. Ostrich\r\n', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
