(3869, 290, 2, 'Jay walks 1km to the east on 1st day, from there, he\r\nwalks 2km to the north on 2nd day. Similarly from there, he walks 3km to the west on 3rd day and 4km to the south on 4th day. If he repeats this process after each day ( i.e. 5km to the east on 5th day, 6km to the north on 6th day and so on..), then how far will he be from the starting point after 1000 days?\r\n', '500500 km		', '707.10 km', '1410.42 km	', '1000 km', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
