(3871, 290, 2, 'Which statements are necessary to answer the following question: <br>\r\nWhat is the average marks of the full class? <br><b>Statement 1:</b> Average marks of girls is 60 and\r\n                       Average marks of the boys in 80. <br>\r\n<b>Statement 2:</b> ratio of boys to girls in the class is 3:2.\r\n', 'statement 1 only', 'statement 2 only', 'both 1 & 2.    ', 'None of these', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1),
