(3873, 290, 2, 'A cube is having dimensions 3.5cm x 3.5cm x 3.5 cm.\r\n How many smaller cubes can be made from it by making\r\n total 6 cuts, if the cuts can be made only in a direction\r\n parallel to any of the cubesâ€™ faces? \r\n', '8', '343', 'Smaller pieces wonâ€™t be perfect cubes so 0', '27', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
(3874, 290, 2, 'Which statements are necessary to answer the\r\nfollowing question â€“  What is the last digit of the expression :  (x<sup>y</sup>)<sup>2</sup> , where x and y are natural numbers?<br>\r\n<b>Statement 1 : </b> value of x = 19<br>\r\n<b>Statement 2 : </b>value of y = 20\r\n', 'statement 1 only. 	       ', 'statement 2 only.', 'both 1 & 2.', 'even after using both, answer canâ€™t be found.', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1),
