(3878, 290, 2, 'If +, -, x, / operations are replaced by the symbols \r\n1, 2 ,3 and 4 respectively and 1, 2, 3, 4 numbers are\r\nreplaced by the symbols +, -, x, / then what will be the value of the expression :/ - x /   2   x + + x   ?\r\n', '+ + x +', '+ x / -', '- + / +', '+ + - + ', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
