(3107, 266, 2, '<b>Instructions for the questions:</b><br> Fill in the blanks by choosing the most appropriate pair. <br><br>\r\nNo matter how truly ________ an idea may be when introduced into the problem area, a connection will _________ develop.\r\n', 'disconnected, eventually', 'distinctive, indolently', 'grandiose, subsequently', 'marvelous, plausibly', '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1),
