(3536, 279, 2, '<b>Directions for the question</b><br>\r\nA, S, M and Dare functions of x and y, and they are defined as follows:<br>		\r\nA(x, y) = x + y<br>\r\nS(x, y) = (x â€“ y) ^ 2<br>\r\nM(x, y) = x ^ y<br>\r\nD(x, y) = x/y, where y â‰  0.<br>\r\nWhat is the value of S (M(x, y), A(y, x)) for x = 2, y = 3\r\n', '25', '9', '1', 'None of these', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1),
