(3549, 279, 2, '<b>Directions for question</b><br>\r\nRefer the following data to answer the questions given below.A flat is shared by six friends â€“ Lochana, Madhuri, Prerna, Vaishali, Neha and Krithika. They are arranging a cleaning schedule for the six days of the week so that each of them will clean on only one day of the week. The following is the agreement that they have. <br>\r\nI. Madhuri cleans either on Tuesday or on Saturday. <br>\r\nII. If Lochana cleans on Monday, Prerna cleans onThursday; Prerna does not clean on Thursday unless Lochana cleans on Monday. <br>\r\nIII. If Lochana cleans on Monday, Krithika cleans on Friday; Krithika does not clean on Friday unless Lochana cleans on Monday. <br>\r\nIV. If Neha does not clean on Wednesday, then Lochana cleans on Wednesday. <br>\r\nV. If Lochana cleans on Thursday, Vaishali cleans on Friday. <br>\r\nVI. If Madhuri cleans on Tuesday, Neha cleans on Friday. <br>\r\nVII. If Krithika cleans on Saturday, Vaishali cleans on Thursday. <br>\r\nWhich of the following is an acceptable order in which the friends can clean from Monday to Saturday?\r\n', 'Vaishali, Madhuri, Lochana, Neha, Prerna, Krithika', 'Madhuri, Lochana, Krithika, Prerna, Neha, Vaishali', 'Krithika, Neha, Madhuri, Prerna, Vaishali, Lochana', 'Prerna, Madhuri, Lochana, Vaishali, Neha, Krithika', '', 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 1),
